# Build the elf mage who carries the four illusion spells, and SAVE him.
#
# This script exists to make tools/fixtures/chars/elf-mage-illusions-seed1.sav.
# It is not a check. tools/check_illusion_flags.sh loads the fixture instead of
# replaying this, because an rID is a position and one resource added to lib/
# would otherwise give the check a different character. See
# tools/fixtures/README.md.
#
# The character is an elf, because the elf monster template is the one that
# grants CA_SHARP_SENSES (lib/races.irh:952), and that ability pierces an
# ordinary illusion with no saving throw at all (src/Creature.cpp:2281-2284).
# Elf, Drow and Grey Elf are the only three player races that grant it; no
# dwarf, lizardfolk or kobold does.
#
# The four spells are learned through wizard mode rather than taken at
# generation, because a first-level mage is never offered them: the level-1
# pick list holds Chromatic Orb through Wizard Lock and no Phantasmal Force.
#
# Infinite Mana is switched on so the saved character can cast all four
# spells in one session whatever his mana pool is. Freeze Monsters is switched
# on so nothing walks up and writes over the message a check has to read.

@include chargen-elf-mage.keys
ESC

w
y
@choose "Wizard Mode Switches"
DOWN*7          # Infinite Mana is the 8th switch (OPT_NODEATH..., inc/Defines.h:4137-4147)
SPACE
DOWN*3          # Freeze Monsters is the 11th.
SPACE
ESC

w
@choose "Learn Any Spell"
"Phantasmal Force" ENTER
w
@choose "Learn Any Spell"
"Improved Phantasmal Force" ENTER
w
@choose "Learn Any Spell"
"Spectral Force" ENTER
w
@choose "Learn Any Spell"
"Improved Spectral Force" ENTER

ESC b           # System Menu, [b] Save and Continue -- the only save that does
                # not also end the session. tools/fixtures/README.md requires it.
